# Kept in git so every deploy ships backend/storage/policies/ on the server.
# PolicyFileService::store() writes uploaded PDFs/DOCX here (private storage,
# never webroot). Without this file the directory is gitignored-and-absent in
# a fresh checkout, rsync never creates it, and production uploads fail with
# "Policy storage is not available" while localhost (where the dir already
# exists from local uploads) keeps working.
